findings.evidence:
Content-Security-Policy:
  default-src 'self' https://*;
  script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://*;
  style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://*;
  img-src 'self' data: blob: https://*;
  connect-src 'self' webpack: https://*;

Problematisch:
- 'unsafe-inline' erlaubt beliebige Inline-Scripts
- 'unsafe-eval' erlaubt eval(), Function() etc.
- https://* erlaubt Scripts von jeder HTTPS-Domain
